<title>USA: Fort Bend buys Mitchell Mortgage stake.</title>
<headline>Fort Bend buys Mitchell Mortgage stake.</headline>
<dateline>ROSENBERG, Texas 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fort Bend Holding Corp said on Friday that it has completed the purchase of a 51 percent interest in Mitchell Mortgage Co, the mortgage banking affiliate of The Woodlands Corp, for $2.6 million.</p>
<p>Mitchell Mortgage currently has a servicing portfolio of approximately $600 million.</p>
<p>The Woodlands Corp is a subsidiary of Mitchell Energy &amp; Development Corp.</p>
